      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HAMLET.\nTwo thousand souls and twenty thousand ducats\nWill not debate the question of this straw!\nThis is th’imposthume of much wealth and peace,\nThat inward breaks, and shows no cause without\nWhy the man dies. I humbly thank you, sir.\n",
